OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'loved' father
OL,4,Cstabbed to death as further arrest made
OL,6,FRelatives of a man who died in Stoke-
OL,7,Fon-Trent have described him as "loved"
OL,8,Fby all of his family.
OL,10,FStaffordshire Police were called at
OL,11,F7.40pm on Thursday 23 July to Ridgway
OL,12,FRoad in Shelton following reports that
OL,13,Fa man had been stabbed.
OL,15,FChristopher Bradbury, 44, from Stoke-
OL,16,Fon-Trent, died at the scene.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
