OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'loved' father
OL,4,Cstabbed to death as further arrest made
OL,6,FA third man, 19, has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder. On Sunday 26
OL,8,FJuly, two men aged 19 and 20, both
OL,9,Ffrom Stoke-on-Trent were arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of murder.
OL,12,FThey remain in police custody for
OL,13,Fquestioning, as does a 25-year-old
OL,14,Fman, from Stoke-on-Trent, who was
OL,15,Farrested previously.
OL,17,FA 17-year-old boy, from Newcastle-
OL,18,Funder-Lyme, who was arrested has been
OL,19,Fbailed with conditions.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
