OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'loved' father
OL,4,Cstabbed to death as further arrest made
OL,6,FA 24-year-old man, from Stoke-on-
OL,7,FTrent, has been released with no
OL,8,Ffurther action.
OL,10,FIn a statement, Mr Bradbury's family
OL,11,Fpaid tribute to him, saying: "He was
OL,12,Floved so much by his mum and partner,
OL,13,Fbrother and sister.
OL,15,F"He will be sadly missed by his father
OL,16,Fand partner."
