OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'loved' father
OL,4,Cstabbed to death as further arrest made
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Ian
OL,7,FFitzgerald from Staffordshire Police
OL,8,Fsaid: "Our thoughts remain with
OL,9,FChristopher's family and friends and
OL,10,Four investigation is continuing."
